on Modern Marvels. On July 18, 1996, TWA Flight

8
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
800 was en route from New York to Paris.

9
00:00:48,001 --> 00:00:53,000
A 747 with 230 passengers and crew, the plane was just south of

10
00:00:53,001 --> 00:00:57,480
island shoreline when something went catastrophically wrong.

