00:01:18,761 --> 00:01:23,000
the senseless loss of life. But the emotional impact

18
00:01:23,001 --> 00:01:28,200
truth about these tragedies. They are extremely rare.

19
00:01:28,201 --> 00:01:32,240
Statistically, more people will die in one month of traffic

20
00:01:32,241 --> 00:01:36,240
accidents than in 40 years of jet travel.

21
00:01:36,241 --> 00:01:39,840
Governments, professional unions, and private companies

22
00:01:39,841 --> 00:01:44,760
endlessly struggle to keep the sky safe.

23
00:01:44,761 --> 00:01:49,760
Still, new tragedies elicit the dread or wound the human psyche

24
00:01:49,761 --> 00:01:53,500
as powerfully as the crash of a commercial jetliner.

25
00:01:53,501 --> 00:01:58,000
They strike at our most primal fears, heights, loss of control,

26
00:01:58,001 --> 00:02:01,760
and even death. They also call into question our

