00:02:09,501 --> 00:02:12,220
understanding these failures is the job of the National

30
00:02:12,221 --> 00:02:16,420
Transportation Safety Board, or NTSB.

31
00:02:16,421 --> 00:02:19,700
Immediately following a plane crash, the agency's

32
00:02:19,701 --> 00:02:24,200
scrambles a GO team to investigate the cause.

33
00:02:24,201 --> 00:02:28,040
NTSB will form a number of investigative groups, and

