36
00:02:34,281 --> 00:02:36,420
Weather, focus on weather issues.

37
00:02:36,421 --> 00:02:40,460
Operations group will focus on pilot training, pilot background.

38
00:02:40,461 --> 00:02:43,560
Aircraft performance group will focus on the structure of the

39
00:02:43,561 --> 00:02:46,200
aircraft. For the team sent to

40
00:02:46,201 --> 00:02:50,500
investigate TWA Flight 800, the first hindrance was that the

41
00:02:50,501 --> 00:02:54,700
wreckage lay in over 125 feet of water.

42
00:02:54,701 --> 00:02:58,340
Navy salvage teams were brought in to plot the debris field with

