45
00:03:06,561 --> 00:03:10,960
We see pieces from the center near the wing of the aircraft.

46
00:03:10,961 --> 00:03:14,860
Then we have the nose of the aircraft, and then we have a much

47
00:03:14,861 --> 00:03:18,860
much larger wreckage area that has the fuselage wings and all

48
00:03:18,861 --> 00:03:20,660
