49
00:03:20,661 --> 00:03:23,600
So the wreckage isn't laid out as you would expect.

50
00:03:23,601 --> 00:03:26,900
It's not tail, center section, nose.

51
00:03:26,901 --> 00:03:30,240
It's center section, nose, tail.

52
00:03:30,241 --> 00:03:32,980
The debris field confirmed that the center of the plane,

53
00:03:32,981 --> 00:03:36,280
