59
00:03:52,260 --> 00:03:55,260
In the investigation process used by the Safety Board,

60
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,860
everything's on the table when we start.

61
00:03:57,960 --> 00:04:01,780
We collect all the pieces of information from every source.

62
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,680
Everything's a possibility.

