76
00:04:45,361 --> 00:04:48,100
But investigators needed more

77
00:04:48,101 --> 00:04:52,520
and set out to rebuild 93 feet of the shattered plane.

78
00:04:52,521 --> 00:04:55,600
Oddly, once the reconstruction was complete,

